ers and that  Margaret is the real killer  here we see her praying with someone  looming in the background it's not mr.  jingles here no trench coat or bowlegged  feet we also see this shot of Margaret  having survived the massacre and she  tells hopple that even though  she's been warned a psychopath might be  on the loose camp redwood will open as  scheduled at the dock rook comes across  a floating dead body and noticed the  slashes to her face we don't yet know  who this person is but this is probably  what Spurs Brooke to go to Margaret and  tell them they're in danger but Margaret  isn't having any of it here's a lovely  game of spin the bottle where Montana  finally gets some one-on-one action with  Brooke and there goes Trevor with his  pants off again someone turns off the  lights and judging by the well polished  nails this is a woman and if we  backtrack earlier in the preview look  who has the exact same nails Margaret  this is just more evidence that Margaret  is the real killer  now I'm not convinced this neck shot of  the lights going out and near Xavier is  linked to the shutdown we just saw  mainly because this random dude pushes  him away my guess is that this might be  some sort of detective that's been sent  to investigate and he's actually helping  Xavier from the real killer now we have  hopple being attacked by what appears to  be mr. jingles but since we don't see  his face it could be a fake out Montana  and Rita tumble through the forest and  here we have the night stalker about to  stab Brooke now I'm a little conflicted  here because if you stop the frame here  it doesn't look like he's actually gonna  stab her rather the doc you know just to  scare her but in the next scene we do  see her with a stab wound to the  shoulder jingles is seen killing this  man here who I believe is this same  character who grabbed Xavier that we saw  earlier we have what appears to be some  sort of trap which we'll see later and  look at this shot it's mr. jingles  holding a man wearing an identical  raincoat perhaps this was the man we saw  earlier going after hopple we do not  know his identity  Rita tries to flag down help and is  almost run over it could be Xavier here  since we see him in the van but it could  be another fake out I love this shot of  mr. jingles again we don't see his face  but you can see his collection of ears  dangling from his belt  Brooke looks shocked to see something  and we get a few shots of Rey trying to  escape from a pit the most intriguing  one is here in which we do see jingles  pouring gasoline over him which really  puts a wrench in the theory that jingles  is here for a revenge on just Margaret  we do  know that Ray's job is in orderly what  if he was in orderly at the same  hospital mr. jingles was at that could  definitely be gasoline worthy I also  have a ton of questions like how jingles  would have time to make these elaborate  traps so there's obviously someone  helping or other people involved in one  way or another this shot here kind of  confirms it as jingles or at least  someone who's dressed like jingles let's  this motorcyclist leave without chasing  him but I think we'll learn more about  what motivates jingles in the episodes  to come since we get this shot of him at  the insane asylum he probably had  electroshock therapy done to him so who  knows what's going on in his mind and  look here new character doesn't seem to  be having a good time though poor Chet  seems to have found himself in the same  pit that we saw rayon and Xavier is  consoled by what appears to be Montana  we have the Night Stalker spooking the  [ __ ] out of Rita and look here another  ring coat clad dude throwing a Molotov  cocktail into the cabin it looks like  we're gonna have multiple mr. jingles  slash copycat killers I'm wondering if  these trenchcoat guys might be linked to  the Night Stalker and some Satanist cult  now this is great I'm pretty sure this  is jingles fighting the Night Stalker  will get a better shot of this later  where he literally picks him up with  superhuman strength and notice also  another trap in the background  perhaps he saves one of the campers this  way and is defending them by taking on  the Night Stalker and holy [ __ ] another  crazy trap a giant log with spikes on it  we see what I think is the real mr.  jingles here taking a tire iron to the  face of the hiker but again I think this  is a flashback so who knows why the  hiker is being attacked that was a lot  to unpack and honestly I'm not sure if  that raised more questions than it  solved I hope you'll give this video a  like and subscribe with the Belon  because I'll be covering the whole  season of AHS you can also follow me on  twitter at think story whitey and until  next time remember daddy loves you very  much
 

